# No Admitted.
theories/RelateEdgePosOrder.v
# Wires the exact edge-position comparator to real segment geometry: an
# intersection point's along-edge parameter is the det/det ratio
# cross(C,D,A)/(cross(C,D,A)-cross(C,D,B)) (inter_param_lands: lands on both
# lines); over integer coords num/den are IZR of idet's (cross_ptZ_is_idet);
# so along-edge order = one integer cross-multiply (inter_order_by_cross, via
# RelateEdgePosOrder.pos_lt_iff_cross).  No Admitted.
theories/RelateEdgeInterParam.v
# Lifts the pairwise comparator to a strict TOTAL ORDER (eplt_trans is the
# nonlinear crux; StrictOrder instance + trichotomy), gives a decidable
# comparator (epcompare = pos_compare), and proves a comparator-sorted edge is
# monotone in real position (sorted_eplt_monotone) — the rounding-free noding
# sequence.  Order theory is pure Z; only the R-agreement + sort corollary
# touch reals.  No Admitted.
theories/RelateEdgePosSort.v
