# The typed obstacle-distance metric for LEC (the chord path's replacement):
# filled-disc max(0, |P-c| - r) and full-circle-ring ||P-c| - r| are the
# EXACT set distances (reverse-triangle lower bound + radial-projection
# attainment), emptiness against an infinite obstacle collapses to one
# comparison (empty_disk_disc_iff / empty_disk_ring_iff), collections
