# zero-length facet collapsing to the POINT row (seg_dist_degenerate).  The
# UNCLAMPED supporting-line foot is REFUTED (3-4-5 witness: foot says 4, the
# facet's endpoint is at 5).  Oracle OBSTACLE_DISTANCE SEG row §H pins.
# Full-only: imports LargestEmptyCircle.v, LECObstacleDistance.v.
theories/LECSegmentRow.v

# The LEC n-ary FLATTEN row (ledger rung "CompoundCurve / n-ary flatten"
